          <h3>Publish online</h3>
          <p>Upload this file to any static hosting service such as GitHub Pages, Netlify, Vercel or your web host. The site will run immediately without extra configuration.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Share public link</h3>
          <p>After hosting online, copy the website URL and send it to your visitors. Customers can browse products, use the cart, and submit orders.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div>
        <h4>LYES SHOP</h4>
        <p>A premium e-commerce interface built for modern selling. Manage the store from a secure dashboard.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Quick links</h4>
        <a href="javascript:navigate('home')">Home</a>
        <a href="javascript:navigate('shop')">Products</a>
        <a href="javascript:navigate('contact')">Contact</a>
